    "clashSummary": "TAPPED24 vs DOMI DUSK took place on **PenGame Rap Battle 2025**. The battle is not presented with an official judging section in the transcript, so the result has to be treated as an **Archive Judgement**.\n\nDOMI DUSK goes first.\n\nDOMI opens round one with a strong attack on TAPPED24’s image, hygiene, appearance, drug use, poverty and stage presence. He says PenGame is letting anyone battle now, compares TAPPED24 to someone found sleeping under a bus stop, attacks his eyes, age, rotten teeth, tinfoil jewellery, Gollum-like look, rat image, bad smell and homelessness. He builds a full “Tap / tap water / have a bath” section, then flips TAPPED24’s name into “crap twenty-four,” “whack twenty-four,” and “trash twenty-four.” It is a clear, aggressive opener.\n\nTAPPED24 responds with more personality than structure. He mocks DOMI for not being in the tournament, calls him a crybaby, uses “Miss Bochi” and chemo material, then goes into a bullying-style flow where he repeatedly calls himself a bully and says he will slap DOMI out of his durag and hoodie. He also says DOMI is aggressive and slaps his mum, then closes with hygiene and job-loss material. The round has energy and crowd humour, but it feels shorter and less complete than DOMI’s opener.\n\nRound two is where TAPPED24 gets his biggest moment. DOMI starts by attacking TAPPED24’s name, smell, teeth, brain, mum, ugliness, ringtone, Santa’s elf image, relevance, crackhouse, pepper stew, iPad/tablet wordplay, standards, GCSE joke and more “crap twenty-four” name flips. It is another strong DOMI round with clean structure and lots of direct punches.\n\nTAPPED24’s second is his most explosive round. He opens with “Narnia boy, come out of the closet,” then goes into Ghana, BBC, durag, waves, overcrowded house, African names, visa/boat material, plantain, FENDRY, “big pun,” hangman, backhand and grandad bars. The content is heavily racial and immigration-based, so it should be treated strictly as offensive battle material. However, in the room it gets the biggest reaction of the battle, including a beat switch/reload moment. This is TAPPED24’s clearest winning round.\n\nRound three swings the battle back to DOMI. He says he is tired of clashing bad-man wannabes, attacks the TAPPED24 name, birth certificate, smell, teeth, lack of women, Zeus, food, Ghana, English pronunciation, beginner status and flag/identity angle. The “LGBTQ / let’s get bitches together” section gets a clear reaction, and DOMI finishes with a stronger, more complete round.\n\nTAPPED24’s third starts confidently, saying he is still winning, but the round is less controlled. He brings “M charge,” wage war, stage four/cancer, forehead jokes, acid-face material, “Domilax / dominate,” gym/yam/food angle and one attempted setup with Kyra, but the reload is not fully accepted and the round fizzles out. He has moments, but it does not land as strongly as his second.\n\nThere is no official decision in the transcript. Based on completion, structure and round control, the Archive Judgement goes to **DOMI DUSK 2-1**.",
